}


::Q004::[markdown]ἐν + dat:{
	~%-100%into#Incorrect. **εἰς + acc** means “into” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%through#Incorrect. **διά + gen** means “through” (Chapter 3).
	~%100%in#Correct: **ἐν + dat** → “in” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%in order that#Incorrect. **ἵνα, ὡς, ὅπως** means “in order that” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%in front of#Incorrect. **πρό + gen** means “in front of” (Chapter 2).
}


